<title>USA: United Steelworkers says has tentative agreement.</title>
<headline>United Steelworkers says has tentative agreement.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, Va. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Steelworkers of America said it has reached a tentative agreement with the Yokohama Tire Co on a new contract that covers 900 union members.</p>
<p>The union said members of Local Union 1023L will vote on the agreement's terms on Aug 2, with terms released afterwards.</p>
